      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hartford_City%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Overhead Door, founded in 1923, and 3M, arriving in 1955, replaced Hartford City’s glass factories as major employers.",
